      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UPTOWN CHANCE (11) had been racing consistently so deserved the last-start win at Menangle, getting home by a narrow margin. May need an ounce of luck from a back row draw but he goes well here and has the talent to collect the prize again. YIRRADIVA (8) drew on the back row and worked when racing wide but stuck on for a 1.8m second here last week. That was her first outing for eight weeks so while she draws wide she should be improved.  IM NO TROUBLE (9) kicked off his campaign with back-to-back seconds at this circuit and distance then broke through with a win last start by 3.6 metres at Goulburn. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Race fit now and hasn't missed a place in six tries here, winning three. ROCK WITH THE BEST (10) owns a good record at this distance and could play a role if things go his way from the back row.",
